# ── Raw data — NEVER commit (see CLAUDE.md, DVC is in the stack) ──
# Third-party datasets and participant data are distributed
# out-of-band (DVC / shared drive), not through git.
#
#   rppg/PPG_Dataset/RawData  — PPG glucose set, 23 subjects, licence unconfirmed
#   rppg/PPG_Dataset/Labels   — glucometer ground truth
#   rppg/PPG_Dataset/Figures  — waveform plots
#   rppg/PPG_Dataset/brno     — BUT PPG (CC-BY 4.0)
#
# This repo is PUBLIC. Human-subjects physiological data does not go in it.
rppg/PPG_Dataset/RawData/
rppg/PPG_Dataset/Labels/
rppg/PPG_Dataset/Figures/
rppg/PPG_Dataset/brno/

